From 6e092d311029c79d92a2f48cc006b61713c42612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RivonClaw CI <ci@rivonclaw.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 12:07:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] vendor(openclaw): keep Playwright out of Windows CLI
 registration

Why:
- OpenClaw fa62fccb867 eagerly pulls browser action policy and Playwright into CLI registration.
- Windows vendor builds then fail while rendering source browser help for CLI startup metadata.
- Backports upstream commit b1b2608f8ca9a56d573487c7eae8ecbdfa3aa8cc (PR #127035).

Removal:
- Drop this patch when the pinned vendor contains b1b2608f8ca9a56d573487c7eae8ecbdfa3aa8cc or equivalent Windows CLI registration laziness.

Tests:
- apps/desktop/src/gateway/vendor-browser-windows-cli-laziness.sentinel.test.ts
